---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Sign Up — Full Access $1.99/month | GoAustralia.co.nz" description="Start your $1.99/month subscription and get instant access to all moving guides, suburb finder, full checklist and weekly newsletter.">
<style is:global>
  /* ── SIGNUP PAGE ── */
  .signup-section {
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 52px 0 72px;
  }
  .signup-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: start;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Left — form card */
  .signup-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,32,92,0.07);
  }
  .signup-card-title {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .signup-card-sub {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--txt3);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .signup-field {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .signup-field label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--txt3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .signup-input {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 11px 13px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--txt);
    background: var(--white);
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.12s;
  }
  .signup-input:focus {
    border-color: var(--blue);
    outline: 3px solid rgba(0,94,165,0.15);
    outline-offset: 0;
  }
  .signup-submit {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.12s;
    margin-top: 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .signup-submit:hover {
    background: #004a85;
  }
  .signup-stripe {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--txt3);
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .signup-stripe svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .signup-login {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-lt);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--txt3);
  }
  .signup-login a {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .signup-login a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* Right — what you get */
  .signup-right {}
  .signup-right-title {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .signup-price-block {
    background: var(--navy);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .signup-price-big {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .signup-price-detail {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  }
  .signup-trust-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .signup-trust-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--txt2);
  }
  .signup-trust-star {
    color: #f59e0b;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .signup-mini-reviews {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .signup-mini-review {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-lt);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
  }
  .signup-mini-stars {
    color: #f59e0b;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .signup-mini-review p {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--txt2);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .signup-mini-reviewer {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
  }
  .signup-mini-reviewer span {
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--txt3);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .signup-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>

<!-- PAGE HERO (minimal) -->
<section class="page-hero" style="padding: 28px 0 22px;">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">← Home</a> / <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a> / Sign up</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: 1.6rem;">Get Full Access — $1.99/month</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-sub">Instant access to all guides, tools and newsletter. Cancel anytime.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SIGNUP SPLIT -->
<section class="signup-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="signup-grid">

      <!-- LEFT: FORM -->
      <div class="signup-card">
        <p class="signup-card-title">Create your account</p>
        <p class="signup-card-sub">Start your $1.99/month subscription today</p>

        <form method="post" action="/api/signup" novalidate>
          <div class="signup-field">
            <label for="name">Full name</label>
            <input
              id="name"
              name="name"
              type="text"
              class="signup-input"
              placeholder="Jane Smith"
              autocomplete="name"
              required
            />
          </div>

          <div class="signup-field">
            <label for="email">Email address</label>
            <input
              id="email"
              name="email"
              type="email"
              class="signup-input"
              placeholder="you@example.com"
              autocomplete="email"
              required
            />
          </div>

          <div class="signup-field">
            <label for="password">Password</label>
            <input
              id="password"
              name="password"
              type="password"
              class="signup-input"
              placeholder="Choose a password (8+ characters)"
              autocomplete="new-password"
              required
              minlength="8"
            />
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="signup-submit">
            Start for $1.99/month →
          </button>
        </form>

        <div class="signup-stripe">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
          </svg>
          Secured by Stripe · Cancel anytime
        </div>

        <div class="signup-login">
          Already have an account? <a href="/login">Log in →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT: WHAT YOU GET -->
      <div class="signup-right">
        <p class="signup-right-title">What's included</p>

        <div class="signup-price-block">
          <span class="signup-price-big">$1.99</span>
          <span class="signup-price-detail">/ month NZD</span>
        </div>

        <div class="signup-trust-bar">
          <div class="signup-trust-item">
            <span class="signup-trust-star">★</span>
            4.9 rating
          </div>
          <div class="signup-trust-item">
            12,400+ users
          </div>
          <div class="signup-trust-item">
            Updated weekly
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Kiwi Masterguide PDF (78 pages)</li>
          <li>Tax &amp; Finance Guide PDF</li>
          <li>Australian Jobs Guide PDF</li>
          <li>Full 70-step moving checklist</li>
          <li>Suburb Finder — compare any suburb</li>
          <li>Unlimited blog access</li>
          <li>Weekly newsletter — policy updates</li>
          <li>Priority email Q&amp;A support</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="signup-mini-reviews">
          <div class="signup-mini-review">
            <div class="signup-mini-stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p>"The tax guide alone was worth 10x the price. I had no idea about the NZ / AU tax implications."</p>
            <p class="signup-mini-reviewer">Jess T. <span>— Melbourne</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="signup-mini-review">
            <div class="signup-mini-stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p>"Suburb Finder made choosing where to live so easy. We knew exactly what we were getting into."</p>
            <p class="signup-mini-reviewer">Mark &amp; Amy R. <span>— Sydney</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="signup-mini-review">
            <div class="signup-mini-stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p>"Plain English, Kiwi-specific, actually useful. Everything the government sites aren't."</p>
            <p class="signup-mini-reviewer">Sam O. <span>— Brisbane</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
